fn write_clip_path_defs(&self, svg: &mut SvgElem) {
    if self.clip_paths.is_empty() {
        return;
    }

    let mut defs = svg.elem("defs");
    for (id, path) in self.clip_paths.iter() {
        defs.elem("clipPath").attr("id", id).with(|svg| {
            svg.elem("path").attr("d", path);
        });
    }
}
```

Key points:
- Called in finalize. If no clip paths, returns early (no empty `<defs>`).
- Creates a `<defs>` element.
- For each (id, path) in the clip_paths Deduplicator, creates `<clipPath id="..."><path d="..."/></clipPath>`.
- The id matches what render_group referenced via `clip-path="url(#id)"`.

